# 15_ganzflicker_RGB.ledc — Ganzflicker Imagery, RGB inner/outer build (base: 15_ganzflicker_imagery; name shortened for SPIFFS 32-char limit)
# RGB variant of 15_ganzflicker_imagery. Audio + speech IDENTICAL (10 Hz isochronic +
# +/-0.5 Hz float). This is the cool-white FLICKER variant (warm Ganzfeld = 31). On this
# build the 10 Hz flicker becomes a RADIAL wave: inner ring (mask 9) and outer ring
# (mask 6) run 180 antiphase with a SINE gate, so the field pulses inner<->outer — the
# expanding/contracting rings strongly evoke Kluver form-constants. Locked in the 8-12 Hz
# bright-safe band; brightness <=30%. See base header for safety.
#
# LED: time freq duty bright R G B mask [env phase]   (env 1 = gentle sine gate)

# --- Induction (10 Hz): vol + light fade in ---
0 10 50 >0 200 220 255 9 1 0     # inner cool-white: 10 Hz sine, fade-in
0 10 50 >0 200 220 255 6 1 180   # outer: antiphase (radial)
A 0 200 0 >0 10 1                 # isochronic 200 Hz pulsed at 10 Hz; vol fade-in
S 3000 default 47 "Let your eyes rest closed and soften your gaze."
15000 10 50 30 200 220 255 9 1 0  # inner: 30% cap reached
15000 10 50 30 200 220 255 6 1 180 # outer
30000 10 50 ~25:30:10000 200 220 255 9 1 0   # inner: breathing 25<->30%
30000 10 50 ~25:30:10000 200 220 255 6 1 180 # outer
A 60000 200 0 100 10 1             # vol settled, beat 10 Hz

# --- Imagery hold: float 9.5<->10.5 Hz (8 s/cycle), radial ---
240000 ~9.5:10.5:8000 50 ~25:30:10000 200 220 255 9 1 0   # inner: freq floats, sine gate
240000 ~9.5:10.5:8000 50 ~25:30:10000 200 220 255 6 1 180 # outer: antiphase (radial form-constants)
A 240000 200 0 100 ~9.5:10.5:8000 1   # isochronic beat floats, locked 1:1
S 240000 default 47 "Watch the geometric shapes and colors begin to form."
S 480000 default 47 "Let the patterns move and shift — just observe, without holding on."
S 720000 default 47 "Colors and forms arise on their own. Stay with them, at ease."

# --- Soft fade: settle to 10 Hz, brightness + vol fade to 0 over 4 min ---
960000 10 50 >30 200 220 255 9 1 0   # inner: steady 10 Hz; bright 30->0
960000 10 50 >30 200 220 255 6 1 180 # outer
A 960000 200 0 >100 10 1           # beat settles to 10 Hz; vol 50->0
S 960000 default 47 "Gently returning now. Let the images fade."
1200000 10 50 0 200 220 255 9 1 0    # inner off
1200000 10 50 0 200 220 255 6 1 180  # outer off
A 1200000 200 0 0 10 1             # volume 0
